#. Translators: dialog title shown when trying to install the add-on on unsupported systems.
#: addon\installTasks.py:24
msgid "Enhanced Touch Gestures install warning"
msgstr "Предупреждение за инсталиране на „Подобрени сензорни жестове“"

#. No touch hardware whatsoever
#. Translators: dialog text shown when trying to install the add-on on unsupported systems.
#: addon\installTasks.py:29
msgid "This device does not support touch interaction. A touch capable device is required to use add-on features."
msgstr "Това устройство не поддържа сензорно взаимодействие. За използване на функциите на добавката е необходимо устройство със сензорни възможности."

#. Portable NVDA running on a touch capable hardware
#. Translators: dialog text shown when trying to install the add-on on unsupported systems.
#: addon\installTasks.py:33
msgid "You are using a portable copy of NVDA and the device supports touch interaction. NVDA must be installed to use add-on features."
msgstr "Използвате преносимо копие на NVDA и устройството поддържа сензорно взаимодействие. NVDA трябва да бъде инсталиран, за да използвате функциите на добавката."

#. Translators: The name of a touch mode.
#: addon\globalPlugins\enhancedTouchGestures.py:36
msgid "text mode"
msgstr "текстов режим"

#. Translators: The name of a touch mode.
#: addon\globalPlugins\enhancedTouchGestures.py:38
msgid "object mode"
msgstr "обектен режим"

#. Translators: The name of a touch mode used when in browse mode.
#: addon\globalPlugins\enhancedTouchGestures.py:40
msgid "browse mode"
msgstr "режим на разглеждане"

#. Translators: The name of a touch mode.
#: addon\globalPlugins\enhancedTouchGestures.py:42
msgid "synth settings mode"
msgstr "режим за настройки на синтезатора"

#. Translators: The gestures category for this add-on in input gestures dialog (2013.3 or later).
#. Add-on summary/title, usually the user visible name of the add-on
#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
#: addon\globalPlugins\enhancedTouchGestures.py:54 buildVars.py:21
msgid "Enhanced Touch Gestures"
msgstr "Подобрени сензорни жестове (Enhanced Touch Gestures)"

#. Translators: input help message for Enhanced touch Gestures command.
#: addon\globalPlugins\enhancedTouchGestures.py:153
msgid "Emulates pressing tab on the system keyboard"
msgstr "Емулира натискането на TAB от системната клавиатура"

#. Translators: input help message for Enhanced touch Gestures command.
#: addon\globalPlugins\enhancedTouchGestures.py:161
msgid "Emulates pressing shift+tab on the system keyboard"
msgstr "Емулира натискането на Shift+TAB от системната клавиатура"

#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
#: buildVars.py:24
msgid "This add-on provides additional touchscreen gestures for NVDA, including focus reporting and synth settings ring gestures."
msgstr "Тази добавка предоставя допълнителни жестове за сензорния екран при работа с NVDA, включително докладване на фокуса и жестове за пръстена от настройки на синтезатора."

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
#: buildVars.py:29
msgid "* NVDA 2026.2 (64-bit) or later is required.\n"
"* Removed add-on specific version of touch browse mode in favor of NVDA's own touch browse mode functionality. Use NVDA's browse mode settings to configure touch browse mode elements."
msgstr ""

